# Machine-translated from the English (data/common/en/amie-motions-5.ftl) on 2026-11-08, a baseline
# for a translator to correct; the comments are the English file's.
#
# What each Pokémon is seen doing in Pokémon-Amie, an animation a sentence, said behind
# `[pa3ds.amie] descriptions`, the small movements it makes by itself behind `fidgets` too. The
# game says none of this. A message a Pokémon's national number and an animation, the models' own
# kw10_respond to kw60_touch, eating, nodding off and sleep one each: amie-motion-25-happyB is
# Pikachu's. One a form moving unlike its species adds its form, amie-motion-25-1-happyB Pikachu
# Rock Star's, and a female unlike her male adds f, and they are said before the species' own.
#
# Written by agents from the animations census (spike 287's `motions`): each model's every
# animation played at will on the research rig and pictured eight moments across, a sentence
# from the pictures alone, rewritten as whole sentences from the pictures
# cropped close (2026-11-08) after the style chosen for Rock Star Pikachu's and Ralts's.
# The other languages' are a machine's translation of these (2026-11-08), to be corrected.
#
# Generation 5: Victini to Genesect.

